{"availability":"available","full":"celox-sim/celox","name":"celox","description":"Celox HDL Simulator","category":"Other","language":"Rust","stars":10,"forks":1,"created":"2026-02-28T11:52:19Z","updated":"2026-10-19T22:10:43Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"master","homepage":"https://celox-sim.github.io/celox/","topics":[],"demo":"https://celox-sim.github.io/celox/playground/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-19T22:20:30.948Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-19T22:20:30.948Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-19T22:20:30.948Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-03T22:13:41.081Z","stars":10,"forks":1},{"at":"2026-10-04T08:15:58.621Z","stars":10,"forks":1},{"at":"2026-10-06T15:43:24.644Z","stars":10,"forks":1},{"at":"2026-10-08T16:03:21.660Z","stars":10,"forks":1},{"at":"2026-10-11T00:23:10.696Z","stars":10,"forks":1},{"at":"2026-10-15T15:01:42.318Z","stars":10,"forks":1},{"at":"2026-10-19T22:20:30.948Z","stars":10,"forks":1}],"technologies":["Rust"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A compiler-based RTL simulator for Veryl and a synthesizable subset of SystemVerilog.","Celox compiles an elaborated Veryl design into executable simulation kernels and exposes the design through a type-safe TypeScript API. The same kernels can be built from synthesizable SystemVerilog through the Rust API (see SystemVerilog support). It is both a practical way to test RTL with Vitest and an open testbed for exploring how RTL simulators should be structured.","Celox explores a simple question: what does a modern RTL simulator architecture look like when compilation, scheduling, state representation, code generation, and testbench integration are designed together?"],"features":["Veryl-specific analysis ends at a source-independent design representation.","Combinational dependencies and clock domains are scheduled before execution.","A backend-independent IR and state layout are shared by multiple code","Native and WebAssembly execution use the same runtime contract.","The testbench sees the same typed design API regardless of the execution"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/celox-sim/celox/blob/master/README.md","fingerprint":"84713a54659d59b77a811690daac1f72aa4dab1b6aca4f9742e101e34684b383","extractedAt":"2026-10-09T03:39:03.809Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-19T22:20:31.022Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A compiler-based RTL simulator for Veryl and a synthesizable subset of SystemVerilog.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/celox-sim/celox/blob/master/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"84713a54659d59b77a811690daac1f72aa4dab1b6aca4f9742e101e34684b383","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/celox-sim/celox/blob/master/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-19T22:20:31.023Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-19T22:10:43Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/celox-sim/celox/blob/master/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-19T22:20:31.024Z","hash":"84713a54659d59b77a811690daac1f72aa4dab1b6aca4f9742e101e34684b383","originalBytes":8868,"storedBytes":8868,"truncated":false},"lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-19T22:20:30.948Z","qualityPriority":false,"enrichmentAttemptAt":"2026-10-04T21:49:44.439Z","latestRelease":{"name":"v0.10.1","tag":"v0.10.1","publishedAt":"2026-10-04T06:34:34Z","url":"https://github.com/celox-sim/celox/releases/tag/v0.10.1"},"releaseCheckedAt":"2026-10-04T21:49:44.439Z","screenshots":[{"src":"previews/b75efe2f0ed6957e00832c43.jpg","kind":"demo","capturedAt":"2026-10-19T22:37:01.908Z","url":"https://celox-sim.github.io/celox/playground/"}],"demoHealth":{"url":"https://celox-sim.github.io/celox/playground/","attemptedAt":"2026-10-19T22:37:01.908Z","status":"working","checkedAt":"2026-10-19T22:37:01.908Z","lastWorkingAt":"2026-10-19T22:37:01.908Z","target":"https://celox-sim.github.io/celox/playground/","failureCount":0,"consecutiveTemporaryFailures":0,"nextCheckAt":"2026-10-26T22:37:01.908Z","probeVersion":3},"previewAttemptAt":"2026-10-19T22:37:01